OL,3,GNEWSARecycling up one year on from
OL,4,Areduced bin collections
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn authority has said its recycling
OL,7,Frate is the highest it has ever been
OL,8,Fsince it moved to three-weekly black
OL,9,Fbin collections one year ago.
OL,11,FWest Berkshire Council rolled out the
OL,12,Fchange from fortnightly in September
OL,13,Flast year, but hundreds of residents
OL,14,Fwere said to have been unhappy.
OL,16,FIt aimed to increase recycling, reduce
OL,17,Fwaste, and support long-term
OL,18,Fenvironmental goals. Its provisional
OL,19,Frecycling rate for 2025-26 now stands
OL,20,Fat 55%.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
